<attribute name="refinedDescription" nodeId="e2af8745">&lt;p&gt;
    Project roles are expected behavior associated with a specific job or status of an individual or group participating in
    the project. Each individual/group will be expected to act within the scope and content of their assigned role. This
    enables clarity, speed and predictability when collaboration between people is needed throughout the project life
    cycle.
&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;
    Project responsibilities are the duties or obligations an individual or group needs to perform to complete an assigned
    task or job, while acting within the scope and content of the related role. Project responsibilities specify respective
    roles and authorities. Responsibilities will vary from project to project
&lt;/p&gt;</attribute>
